      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. can u go a bit deeper into the libertarian side though? i want to make sure i'm not just making it sound like they're just against taxes for the sake of it. like, what's the actual philosophical core that justifies why property rights should be so absolute even if it means some people suffer? i need the \"strongest\" version like i said.",
